    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City where danger lurks around every corner.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drug cartels, corrupt police, manipulative media, and terror \u2014 all tied into one knot, pulled by a city hall rotten to its core. Here, people don\u2019t live \u2014 they survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a detective, once a symbol of justice, now a forgotten drunk clinging to memories of better days. But the past won\u2019t let go, and the fate of the city suddenly falls into your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can one person challenge the whole system \u2014 or will the city finally drown in darkness? And who is the shadow pushing you forward?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noir pixel atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices that influence the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogues with skill checks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations from dark basements to a train speeding through a snowy desert.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harsh moral dilemmas.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City where danger lurks around every corner.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drug cartels, corrupt police, manipulative media, and terror \u2014 all tied into one knot, pulled by a city hall rotten to its core. Here, people don\u2019t live \u2014 they survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a detective, once a symbol of justice, now a forgotten drunk clinging to memories of better days. But the past won\u2019t let go, and the fate of the city suddenly falls into your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can one person challenge the whole system \u2014 or will the city finally drown in darkness? And who is the shadow pushing you forward?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noir pixel atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices that influence the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogues with skill checks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations from dark basements to a train speeding through a snowy desert.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harsh moral dilemmas.</p></li></ul>",
